STATE DESCRIPTIONS

State            |  Description
———————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————
IDLE             |  Waiting for the customer to select a product
ITEM_SELECTED    |  A valid product has been selected. The machine waits for payment
DISPENSING       |  The machine dispenses the selected product and updates the inventory
RETURN_CHANGE    |  The machine returns any extra money to the customer before completing the transaction
ERROR            |  The machine has detected an invalid selection or invalid payment and waits for the error to be acknowledged




STATE TRANSITION TABLE

CURRENT STATE  |        INPUT/EVENT          |                    CONDITION                      |    NEXT STATE    |  OUTPUT/ACTION
————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————
IDLE           |  select(code)               |  Valid product and in stock                       |  ITEM_SELECTED   |  Display selected product and price
IDLE           |  select(code)               |  Invalid product code                             |  ERROR           |  Display error message: "Invalid selection"
IDLE           |  select(code)               |  Product out of stock                             |  IDLE            |  Display "Sold Out" message
IDLE           |  insert_coin(value)         |  Any input                                        |  IDLE            |  Ignore input and display "Select an item first"
IDLE           |  cancel()                   |  Any input                                        |  IDLE            |  Display "Nothing to cancel"
ITEM_SELECTED  |  insert_coin(value)         |  Payment less than item price                     |  ITEM_SELECTED   |  Update balance and wait for more payment
ITEM_SELECTED  |  insert_coin(value)         |  Payment is equal to or greater than item price   |  DISPENSING      |  Dispense selected product
ITEM_SELECTED  |  insert_coin(value)         |  Invalid coin value (<= 0)                        |  ERROR           |  Display invalid coin error
ITEM_SELECTED  |  cancel()                   |  Any time before dispensing                       |  IDLE            |  Return inserted money and cancel transaction
ITEM_SELECTED  |  select(code)               |  Another selection attempted                      |  ITEM_SELECTED   |  Ignore request and display warning message
DISPENSING     |  Internal(_dispense())      |  No change required                               |  IDLE            |  Dispense item, update inventory, complete transaction
DISPENSING     |  Internal(_dispense())      |  Change required                                  |  RETURN_CHANGE   |  Dispense item and prepare to return change
RETURN_CHANGE  |  Internal(_return_change()) |  Change returned                                  |  IDLE            |  Return change and complete transaction
ERROR          |  acknowledge()              |  Error acknowledged                               |  IDLE            |  Clear error and reset transaction
ERROR          |  cancel()                   |  Any input                                        |  ERROR           |  Ignore request and instruct user to use acknowledge()
